00:07:30.327 --> 00:07:34.360
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:34.959 --> 00:07:40.504
<v Slow>よさこい祭りは、何日間続きますか。

00:07:41.303 --> 00:07:45.336
<v Host>Four days — from August ninth until August twelfth.

00:07:45.935 --> 00:07:51.720
<v Slow>今年は、いくつのチームが参加しますか。

00:07:52.519 --> 00:07:55.112
<v Host>One hundred ninety-seven teams.

00:07:55.711 --> 00:08:11.552
<v Host>That's all for today. From tomorrow, the streets of Kochi will be full of music, colorful costumes, and the sound of wooden clappers. If you visit Japan in summer, a dance festival like this is a wonderful thing to see. See you next time!

00:08:12.151 --> 00:08:14.552
<v News>また明日。
